  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the beef and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the curry powder and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the coconut milk, tomato paste, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook, covered, until the beef is tender, about 20 minutes.",
    "Use a whisk to stir the curry and ensure the sauce is smooth.",
    "Serve hot over rice or with naan bread."
  ],
